 "words_heard": 172,
 "words": 172,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I said I'm rich, I've prospered, and I don't need a thing",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not cold and not hot, just a lukewarm offering",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I was poor and blind and naked and I didn't even know",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And through the rain somebody's knocking, soft and slow",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, I am standing at the door and knocking",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If anyone hears my voice and opens the door",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will come into him and eat with him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he with me",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He said, buy from me gold that's refined by the fire",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "White garments for your shame and salve for your eyes",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Those whom I love I rebuke and discipline",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So be earnest and repent and let me in",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, I am standing at the door and knocking",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If anyone hears my voice and opens the door",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will come into him and eat with him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he with me",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Knock, knock, on a rainy night",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I hear your voice",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, I'm opening the door",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will come into him, meet with him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be with him, be with me",
